WEBVTT

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:08.088
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.118 --> 00:00:11.473
<v><b>M:</b></v> We get up early on Saturday.

00:00:14.563 --> 00:00:15.243
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.261 --> 00:00:18.241
<v><b>F:</b></v> I take a shower at eight.

00:00:21.362 --> 00:00:22.066
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:23.077 --> 00:00:25.172
<v><b>M:</b></v> He starts work at eleven.

00:00:28.218 --> 00:00:28.973
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:30.021 --> 00:00:32.365
<v><b>F:</b></v> He has a coffee with breakfast.

00:00:35.386 --> 00:00:36.186
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:37.273 --> 00:00:40.065
<v><b>M:</b></v> They speak on the phone every evening.

00:00:43.075 --> 00:00:43.973
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:44.953 --> 00:00:47.166
<v><b>F:</b></v> I write a lot of emails.